  "because": "Repairs of F01 and F02 at the user's request (2026-11-19: fix the capture lock and the adapter session). capture_exclusion.rs is now one re-entrant owner (own/disown, another_thread_owns) and graph.rs has no capture_lock; the adapter session is held slot 2 (held_slot, held(), put_adapter_session, release_sessions_to_disk takes only listed slots). Exclusion.v was rewritten with committed blocking calls and a unified/old design knob, and Evict.v made parametric in the eviction policy; every claim was restated for the new code (exclusion, never both blocked, waits on the owner, adapter released only when idle), the old designs kept as the counterexamples. Each anchor was compared line by line with the model and bind.py's grammar",
